The above 3 fields should be the only ones that we considered as part of this update process
As part of this update, the main step in the transformation will include updated the the existing phone value and then automatically adding the '+' sign as a prefix. (As required by the E.164 Format.)

This format is generally understood to be as follows:

"+" & Country Code + Area Code(if applicable) + Unique/Local Phone Digits

