Validation Rules
AC13 – Minimum Phone Number Length Validation
Given a user enters a phone number containing fewer than seven numeric digits
When validation executes
Then the field shall fail validation.

And the user shall receive the following error message:




Plain Text
Phone number must contain a valid country code and telephone number.
