AC14 – Save Prevention for Invalid Numbers
Given a phone number fails validation
When the user attempts to save the Contact record
Then the record shall not be saved.

And the validation error shall remain visible until corrected.

AC15 – Validation Message Removal
Given a validation error is displayed
When the user enters a valid phone number
Then the validation message shall automatically be cleared.

